    - target: {fileID: 2797487852137668043, guid: 83fa2fc39063c1b41b0efe5a160e838d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Hello, it's me, Randy Simon. The creator of Fat Butters' Jetpack Ride. 
        I'm so happy that you're enjoying the game enough to go this deep into the
        settings menu. \n\nI made this game to help support my family and my growing
        studio, Simeck Entertainment. One way that you can help me do that is to
        keep ads enabled. They are optional, but I would appreciate you leaving them
        on.\n\nAs a gesture of my appreciation, every category of ad you enable will
        increase the number of bones you get whenever you complete a level."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
